\tag{milestone}

\p{The symmetry/braiding monads on the corrected profunctor ambient, the ∞-Kleisli theorem, symmetric sequences and operads (\ref{at-sp-0009}/10/13), precisely scoped E_n examples (\ref{at-sp-0011}), general monoidal enrichment, cosmoi, additional shapes and geometric substrate, and a self-hosted kernel. Symmetric monoidal ∞-category examples include their actual \code{Cat_∞} colimit prerequisites. Each extension has its own statement and comparison gate.}
